<title>USA: Chrysler to sell $500 mln in century bonds.</title>
<headline>Chrysler to sell $500 mln in century bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chrysler Corp is preparing to sell $500 million in century bonds via a Salomon Brothers-led syndicate early next week, Salomon Brothers syndicate officials confirmed.</p>
<p>The bonds will be non-callable for 90 years, they said.</p>
<p>Chrysler is expected to kick off the launch on Monday by holding a conference call with investors.  The deal could price soon thereafter.</p>
<p>-U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, ((212-859-1662))</p>
</text>
